admitted and fact-free rather than rejected or invented. This closes the
table set to exactly {versions, libraries, plugins, bundles}, validates
each row against its own closed form (including the multi-line bundle
array and its terminator), and rejects everything else as
UNSUPPORTED_SCHEMA.

Facts for the pinned projection are unchanged. The eight new vectors in
TestCatalogTableSetIsClosed are all admitted-and-ignored under the
previous extractor.

